<title>UK: Hammerson signs contracts for shop centre.</title>
<headline>Hammerson signs contracts for shop centre.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development firm Hammerson Plc said on Tuesday it had signed pre-let contracts with Debenhams and House of Fraser as principal anchors for stores at a new shopping centre in Reading, west of London.</p>
<p>Hammerson said the shopping centre would cost about 215 million stg.</p>
</text>
